# Gradle output directories (module-root build/ only).
#
# IMPORTANT: the old `**/build/` pattern also matched SOURCE packages named `build`
# (e.g. app/src/main/java/mod/jbk/build/, .../mod/hey/studios/build/,
# .../mod/pranav/build/, .../pro/sketchware/ai/tools/build/), silently excluding real
# source files from git. Local builds still worked because the files were on disk, but a
# clean clone (CI, a new machine, a collaborator) was missing them and could not compile.
# The negation below re-includes any `build` directory that lives under a `src/` tree, so
# only genuine Gradle output dirs stay ignored.
.gradle/
build/
**/build/
!**/src/**/build/

# Android Studio
.idea/
*.iml
local.properties
.cxx/

# Kotlin
.kotlin/

# Generated
captures/
.externalNativeBuild/

# Logs
*.log

# OS
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db